cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "smart-city-gis: Urban accessibility analytics for Korean smart city planning"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for urban analytics on Korean city data: walkability scores,
  2SFCA and gravity accessibility models, network-based isochrones, and
  15-minute city indices, with reproducible pipelines from OpenStreetMap and
  Korean public data (NSDI, V-World, KOSIS).
type: software
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DongsooJung/smart-city-gis"
url: "https://stargateedu.co.kr/smart-city-gis/"
keywords:
  - urban analytics
  - accessibility
  - walkability
  - 2SFCA
  - isochrone
  - 15-minute city
